WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.300
At a job interview in the UK you are asked about a normal day. Routines use the present simple.

2
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:22.300
With I, you, we and they the verb stays the same. With he, she and it add -s: work → works, go → goes, have → has.

3
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:32.200
I get up at seven. She has breakfast at eight. He goes to work by bus. Clock times take at.

4
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:43.600
Usually and never go before the verb: I usually walk to work, I never watch TV in the morning. Say three sentences about your day.
